# Test: GLOBAL (VMEM) src with FLAT pending on vmcnt.
# Pre-GFX10: vmcnt 0 (conservative). GFX10+: vmcnt 1 (position-based, unless flag set).
# On GFX12, GLOBAL uses loadcnt, FLAT uses loadcnt/dscnt - loadcnt is shared.
---
name: global_global_with_flat
body: |
  bb.0:
    ; GFX9-LABEL: name: global_global_with_flat
    ; GFX9: FLAT_LOAD_DWORD
